flowchart TB
    Manifest["Frozen protocol and artifact manifest"] --> Integrity{"Identity, bounds and hashes valid?"}
    Integrity -->|No| Unknown["INCONCLUSIVE or integrity failure"]
    Integrity -->|Yes| Evaluate["Evaluate predicates on protected inputs"]
    Evaluate --> Rule{"Predicate and mandatory checks"}
    Rule -->|Contradicted| Reject["REJECTED"]
    Rule -->|Evidence incomplete| Unknown
    Rule -->|Preliminary pass| Support["SUPPORTED"]
    Support --> Replay["Independent replay and challenge as required"]
    Replay --> Outcome{"Rule and dependencies satisfied?"}
    Outcome -->|Yes| Verified["VERIFIED"]
    Outcome -->|Valid contradiction| Reject
    Outcome -->|Missing or invalid evidence| Unknown
    Verified --> Revoke["Append revocation if evidence later invalidates"]
